{'symbol': 'ITW', 'date': '2021-10-29 10:40:00', 'title': 'ITW BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "GLENVIEW, ILL., OCT. 29, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC. (NYSE: ITW) DECLARED A DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK OF $1.22 PER SHARE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021. THE DIVIDEND EQUATES TO $4.88 PER SHARE ON A FULL-YEAR BASIS. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON JANUARY 14, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 31, 2021."}